ARC or PLC in Berks County","/arc-plc/pennsylvania/berks-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in Berks County came in under 90% of normal in September to October in 36 of the 75 years on record since 1951. On that middle, 2025 swung from 185% of normal in May to June 2025 down to 51% in August to September 2025. So far in 2026 the middle shows 61% of normal for May to June 2026, and grid 24515 still holds its driest year at 67% in 1963.</p>"}
